{"id":"618616f65f4acd32","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md","title":"Complex Multiplication","display":"df-complex-multiplication — Complex Multiplication","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-complex-multiplication","aliases":["58-df-complex-multiplication"],"display":"df-complex-multiplication — Complex Multiplication","depends_on":["[[58-df-elliptic-curve]]","[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-complex-multiplication"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-complex-multiplication</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complex-multiplication — Complex Multiplication"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"58-df-elliptic-curve\">58-df-elliptic-curve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,O,K_E\\in V\">\\(E,O,K_E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb C,O,K_E)\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb C,O,K_E)\\)</span> (elliptic-curve predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"58-df-elliptic-curve\">58-df-elliptic-curve</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{End}^{\\mathrm{alg}}_{\\mathbb C}(E,O,K_E)\">\\(\\operatorname{End}^{\\mathrm{alg}}_{\\mathbb C}(E,O,K_E)\\)</span> (the metatheoretic ring of regular <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span>-endomorphisms of the pointed curve represented by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E\">\\(K_E\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]_E\">\\([n]_E\\)</span> (the metatheoretic multiplication-by-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> regular endomorphism)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CM}_S\\)</span> (complex multiplication predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists O,K_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb C,O,K_E)\\land\n\\operatorname{End}^{\\mathrm{alg}}_{\\mathbb C}(E,O,K_E)\n\\supsetneq\\{[n]_E:n\\in\\mathbb Z\\}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists O,K_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb C,O,K_E)\\land\n\\operatorname{End}^{\\mathrm{alg}}_{\\mathbb C}(E,O,K_E)\n\\supsetneq\\{[n]_E:n\\in\\mathbb Z\\}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For a complex elliptic curve, complex multiplication means endomorphisms beyond the integer multiplications.</li>\n<li>Regular morphisms and the canonical chord–tangent group law are algebraic-geometric metatheory not constructed by the set-level short-Weierstrass carrier atom; the turnstile is therefore marked metatheoretic rather than treating an undefined endomorphism ring as a set term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-elliptic-curve","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elliptic-curve]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elliptic-curve","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb C,O,K_E)$ (elliptic-curve predicate, see [[58-df-elliptic-curve]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,O,K_E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb C,O,K_E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{End}^{\\mathrm{alg}}_{\\mathbb C}(E,O,K_E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"K_E","display":false},{"tex":"[n]_E","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists O,K_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb C,O,K_E)\\land\n\\operatorname{End}^{\\mathrm{alg}}_{\\mathbb C}(E,O,K_E)\n\\supsetneq\\{[n]_E:n\\in\\mathbb Z\\}\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1477,"backlinks":[{"id":"a1ce5e591cd3d2b3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CM}_S$ (complex-multiplication predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md]])"},{"id":"0dcb67ff541ccfe3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"afd9c90ddd9c2256","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-334","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md|58-df-complex-multiplication]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["74f4744df7db749f","1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751"]}